1. Save Product

Method: POST

URL

http://localhost:8080/product/save

Headers

Content-Type: application/json

Body (raw → JSON)

{
    "id": 1,
    "name": "Laptop",
    "price": 55000
}
Response
{
    "status": 201,
    "message": "Product Saved Successfully",
    "data": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "Laptop",
        "price": 55000.0
    }
}
2. Get All Products

Method: GET

URL

http://localhost:8080/product/all
Response
{
    "status": 200,
    "message": "Products Retrieved Successfully",
    "data": [
        {
            "id": 1,
            "name": "Laptop",
            "price": 55000.0
        },
        {
            "id": 2,
            "name": "Mobile",
            "price": 25000.0
        }
    ]
}
3. Get Product By Id

Method: GET

URL

http://localhost:8080/product/1
Response
{
    "status": 200,
    "message": "Product Found Successfully",
    "data": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "Laptop",
        "price": 55000.0
    }
}
4. Update Product

Method: PUT

URL

http://localhost:8080/product/update/1

Headers

Content-Type: application/json

Body (raw → JSON)

{
    "name": "Gaming Laptop",
    "price": 65000
}
Response
{
    "status": 200,
    "message": "Product Updated Successfully",
    "data": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "Gaming Laptop",
        "price": 65000.0
    }
}
5. Delete Product

Method: DELETE

URL

http://localhost:8080/product/delete/1
Response
{
    "status": 200,
    "message": "Product Deleted Successfully...",
    "data": null
}
